# Enabled by: the production domain and the decision to serve the site under a sub-path (here /frontx/; SITE_ORIGIN then carries it, https://site.example/frontx). Use this block instead of the root one above; crawlers read robots.txt only at the origin's root, so it is served there too, and the bare origin redirects into the mount.
